---
description: Keep source checkouts small; prevent generated histories and duplicated harness installs
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `docs/contributing/repository-footprint.md`. Persist maintained source,
required fixtures, approved current evidence and concise findings. Scanner runs,
review transcripts, assignments and intermediate outputs stay in ignored `work/`
or private temporary storage; summarize on the PR. Do not append per-run history.
Install third-party skills once under `.agents/skills/`, then run
`node scripts/dev/sync-agent-skills.mjs`; preserve harness-specific variants.
Reuse dependency/build/browser caches. No automatic migration or baseline
creation on session startup. Clean only this task's scratch when finished.
Run `node scripts/quality/repository-size-gate.mjs` before staging.
